{{!
    @template local_evidencehub/hub_report_view

    The hub's list of pairs as a data report (stage E3): the heading with the template picker, one mount
    point, core's own rendering of the report for a browser without JavaScript, and the way to core's table.

    The picker is core's single select, a GET form to index.php that works without JavaScript and submits
    on a change with it. The mount names the bundle (js/esm/bundle.json): one ES module built from
    js/esm/src/views.tsx, whose props name the hub's view in "mount". Its inner content is what the first
    paint shows until React commits, which replaces it: a skeleton in the shape of the band and the grid,
    and, hidden behind it, one sentence that is true only if the component never mounts. styles.css swaps
    the two about 10 s after the first paint, so no pulse lasts for ever. Both are shown only under
    body.jsenabled; only the mounted component draws rows, so a step asserting a worker's name in the view
    asserts that React ran.

    The props arrive already JSON-encoded by local_evidencehub\output\hub_report_view, in one value, through
    a triple stash: nothing between here and React is an HTML context. They carry configuration and
    strings, never a record. The picker and the noscript are core's own HTML, rendered by core.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * title - the page's heading.
    * picker - core's single select of the templates on offer, HTML.
    * locked, contextname - entered from a category: the page says it offers that category's templates only.
    * props - the component's props, JSON.
    * tableurl - index.php with view=table.
    * noscript - core's rendering of the report without its filter form, HTML.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "title": "Evidence hub",
        "picker": "<form method=\"get\"><select name=\"templateid\"><option>Electricians</option></select></form>",
        "locked": true,
        "contextname": "Operations",
        "props": "{\"mount\": \"hub\", \"labels\": {\"loading\": \"Loading the pairs\"}, \"contextid\": 1, \"templateid\": 5}",
        "tableurl": "https://example.com/local/evidencehub/index.php?contextid=1&templateid=5&view=table",
        "noscript": "<p>Core's report</p>"
    }
}}
<div class="local-evidencehub-rview" data-region="local-evidencehub-reportview">
    <div class="local-evidencehub-rview-pagehead">
        <h2 class="local-evidencehub-rview-title">{{title}}</h2>
        <div class="local-evidencehub-rview-picker">{{{picker}}}</div>
    </div>
    {{#locked}}
    <p class="local-evidencehub-rview-locked">{{#str}} hublocked, local_evidencehub, {{contextname}} {{/str}}</p>
    {{/locked}}
    <p class="local-evidencehub-rview-tablelink">
        <a href="{{tableurl}}">{{#str}} hubtableview, local_evidencehub {{/str}}</a>
    </p>
    {{#react}}
    {
        "component": "@moodle/lms/local_evidencehub/bundle",
        "props": {{{props}}},
        "class": "local-evidencehub-rview-mount"
    }
    <div class="local-evidencehub-rview-preload" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="local-evidencehub-rview-band">
            <div class="local-evidencehub-rview-tile local-evidencehub-rview-sk"><span class="local-evidencehub-rview-skb"></span><span class="local-evidencehub-rview-skb local-evidencehub-rview-skb--big"></span></div>
            <div class="local-evidencehub-rview-tile local-evidencehub-rview-sk"><span class="local-evidencehub-rview-skb"></span><span class="local-evidencehub-rview-skb local-evidencehub-rview-skb--big"></span></div>
            <div class="local-evidencehub-rview-tile local-evidencehub-rview-sk"><span class="local-evidencehub-rview-skb"></span><span class="local-evidencehub-rview-skb local-evidencehub-rview-skb--big"></span></div>
            <div class="local-evidencehub-rview-tile local-evidencehub-rview-sk"><span class="local-evidencehub-rview-skb"></span><span class="local-evidencehub-rview-skb local-evidencehub-rview-skb--big"></span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="local-evidencehub-rview-skgrid local-evidencehub-rview-sk">
            <span class="local-evidencehub-rview-skb"></span>
            <span class="local-evidencehub-rview-skb"></span>
            <span class="local-evidencehub-rview-skb"></span>
            <span class="local-evidencehub-rview-skb"></span>
            <span class="local-evidencehub-rview-skb"></span>
        </div>
    </div>
    <p class="local-evidencehub-rview-failed">{{#str}} reportviewmountfailed, local_evidencehub {{/str}}</p>
    {{/react}}
    <noscript>{{{noscript}}}</noscript>
</div>
